{"title":"B3623 - B3623 枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举） - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-27-B3623-B3623-枚举排列-递归实现排列型枚举-洛谷","date":"2026-05-26T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-27T09:42:46.960Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-27-B3623-B3623-枚举排列-递归实现排列型枚举-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<p>&lt;博客&gt;</p>\n<h2 id=\"洛谷-B3623-枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）\"><a href=\"#洛谷-B3623-枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 B3623] 枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）\"></a>[洛谷 B3623] 枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷 <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/B3623\">B3623 枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 枚举、递归</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 排列型枚举，递归算法设计</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 题目要求我们从1到n中选出k个数进行排列，并打印出所有的排列结果。</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: 输入包含两个整数，n和k，表示范围和数量。</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 输出所有排列的结果，每个结果占一行。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>:<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>5 3</code></li>\n<li>输出：<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1 2 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">3 4 5</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>本题的核心是枚举排列，即在1到n的数字中，选择k个数字进行排列。</li>\n<li>问题的关键在于如何有效地生成所有排列，并且不重复。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 直接使用全排列算法，但时间复杂度较高。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用递归，通过选择和不选择每个元素的方式来生成所有排列。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 递归实现排列型枚举是因为其简单直观，适合于小规模数据。</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>: 递归枚举所有可能的选择，然后回溯。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-算法实现\"><a href=\"#4-3-算法实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 算法实现\"></a>4.3 算法实现</h4><ul>\n<li>使用一个布尔数组<code>used</code>来记录哪些数字已经被选中。</li>\n<li>使用一个列表<code>current</code>来记录当前选择的数字。</li>\n<li>定义一个递归函数<code>dfs(pos)</code>，表示当前递归到了第pos个位置。</li>\n<li>当<code>pos</code>等于k时，打印当前排列。</li>\n<li>否则，从1到n遍历每个数字，如果该数字未被选择，则将其添加到<code>current</code>中，并递归调用<code>dfs(pos+1)</code>，然后回溯。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-代码详解\"><a href=\"#4-4-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 代码详解\"></a>4.4 代码详解</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">n, k = <span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split())</span><br><span class=\"line\">used = [<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * (n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">current = []</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">dfs</span>(<span class=\"params\">pos</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> pos == k:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27; &#x27;</span>.join(<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">str</span>, current)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> used[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            used[i] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            current.append(i)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            dfs(pos + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            current.pop()</span><br><span class=\"line\">            used[i] = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">dfs(<span class=\"number\">0</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"4-5-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#4-5-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.5 复杂度分析\"></a>4.5 复杂度分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n!)</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#6-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 输入输出示例\"></a>6. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>5 3</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1 2 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">3 4 5</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#7-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>7. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 忘记回溯，导致某些排列未被输出。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 检查<code>used</code>数组，确保每个数字只被使用一次。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#8-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 总结与扩展\"></a>8. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会了如何使用递归实现排列型枚举。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将此算法应用于生成所有可能的组合、子集等问题。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更高效的排列生成算法，例如次高效率的生成算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<p>&lt;博客&gt;</p>\n<h2 id=\"洛谷-B3623-枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）\"><a href=\"#洛谷-B3623-枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 B3623] 枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）\"></a>[洛谷 B3623] 枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷 <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/B3623\">B3623 枚举排列（递归实现排列型枚举）</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 枚举、递归</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 排列型枚举，递归算法设计</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 题目要求我们从1到n中选出k个数进行排列，并打印出所有的排列结果。</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: 输入包含两个整数，n和k，表示范围和数量。</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 输出所有排列的结果，每个结果占一行。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>:<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>5 3</code></li>\n<li>输出：<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1 2 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">3 4 5</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>本题的核心是枚举排列，即在1到n的数字中，选择k个数字进行排列。</li>\n<li>问题的关键在于如何有效地生成所有排列，并且不重复。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 直接使用全排列算法，但时间复杂度较高。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用递归，通过选择和不选择每个元素的方式来生成所有排列。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 递归实现排列型枚举是因为其简单直观，适合于小规模数据。</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>: 递归枚举所有可能的选择，然后回溯。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-算法实现\"><a href=\"#4-3-算法实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 算法实现\"></a>4.3 算法实现</h4><ul>\n<li>使用一个布尔数组<code>used</code>来记录哪些数字已经被选中。</li>\n<li>使用一个列表<code>current</code>来记录当前选择的数字。</li>\n<li>定义一个递归函数<code>dfs(pos)</code>，表示当前递归到了第pos个位置。</li>\n<li>当<code>pos</code>等于k时，打印当前排列。</li>\n<li>否则，从1到n遍历每个数字，如果该数字未被选择，则将其添加到<code>current</code>中，并递归调用<code>dfs(pos+1)</code>，然后回溯。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-代码详解\"><a href=\"#4-4-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 代码详解\"></a>4.4 代码详解</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">n, k = <span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split())</span><br><span class=\"line\">used = [<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * (n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">current = []</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">dfs</span>(<span class=\"params\">pos</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> pos == k:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27; &#x27;</span>.join(<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">str</span>, current)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> used[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            used[i] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            current.append(i)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            dfs(pos + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            current.pop()</span><br><span class=\"line\">            used[i] = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">dfs(<span class=\"number\">0</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"4-5-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#4-5-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.5 复杂度分析\"></a>4.5 复杂度分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n!)</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#6-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 输入输出示例\"></a>6. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>5 3</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1 2 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 2 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">1 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 4</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 3 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">2 4 5</span><br><span class=\"line\">3 4 5</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#7-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>7. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 忘记回溯，导致某些排列未被输出。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 检查<code>used</code>数组，确保每个数字只被使用一次。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#8-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 总结与扩展\"></a>8. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会了如何使用递归实现排列型枚举。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将此算法应用于生成所有可能的组合、子集等问题。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更高效的排列生成算法，例如次高效率的生成算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"B3623","path":"api/tags/B3623.json"}]}